1742581655000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-8461694993083405628"},"published":{"$t":"2025-03-21T14:27:35.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T21:50:56.518-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Monologues"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Stories"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"top"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"आफ्नै संस्मरण १- किताबका कुरा"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"योगवीर, सकम्बरी, फुलहरू र बुढी पसल्नी लाई पहिले भेटेँ, अन्तरमुखीमा आँफूलाई पाएँ, परिभाषित आँखाहरुले पर्खालबाहिर धुपी सल्ला र लालीगुराँसको फेदीमा पुर्यायो, अनि महत्ताहिनले थाहै नपाइ बैँसालु वर्तमानमा लगेर छाडी राखेको… I. सानो बेलाबाट नै किताबहरूप्रति मेरो बिछट्टकै मोह थियो। अक्षरहरूकै छाँयामा हुर्किएको मेरा लागि किताबहरु आसक्ति मात्रै थिएनन्, साथीहरु नै तिनै बनेका थिए। आजसम्म पनि रहिरहेका केही नजिक"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/8461694993083405628/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/booksandauthors.html#comment-form","title":"1 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8461694993083405628"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8461694993083405628"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/booksandauthors.html","title":"आफ्नै संस्मरण १- किताबका कुरा"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1IsGQsb_AgDOVGrOq8fQqjW3X_SG7ZUEq=s72-w1200-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"1"}}
1734217371000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-8776658989394577911"},"published":{"$t":"2024-12-14T18:02:51.000-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T15:05:19.742-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Monologues"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Ramblings"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"top"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"प्रस्न सोध्यो भनेर पछी लाग्ने हरूलाई जवाफ।"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"कहीदिन अधि, यस्तै कसैको बेतुकका कुरा सुन्दा झर्को लागेर होला, एक जानालाई तीन प्रस्न भन्दै सोध्न सुरु गरेथेँ। १। को/कस्तो राजा ल्याउने? २। राजा कसरि ल्याउने? ३। राजा आएर/ल्याएर के हुन्छ त? मैले सोध्न मिल्थ्यो कि नाईँ,… इलन मस्कले टुइटर किनेर; के-के बनाइसक्यो-बनाइसक्यो अहीले, नभए त म टुइटरमा टिएफसी नेपालकै जमानाबाट, यसैगरी नै छु। शीरासकाजीले “कति मीठो ह्यान्डल” भनेको भरमा, उसैको सम्झनाका लागि, पहीले"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/8776658989394577911/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2024/12/prashna-sodhyo-bhanera.html#comment-form","title":"1 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8776658989394577911"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8776658989394577911"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2024/12/prashna-sodhyo-bhanera.html","title":"प्रस्न सोध्यो भनेर पछी लाग्ने हरूलाई जवाफ।"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1KJQyqFZ8HEXVn0JsXxiG6aBzKXOhqs00=s72-w1600-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"1"}}
1727179115000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-8995555525203937062"},"published":{"$t":"2024-09-24T07:58:35.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T06:34:01.454-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Musings"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali literature"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Stories"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"top"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"कथा: पल्पसाको चिठ्ठी।"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"धत्, बिदाइ कति गार्हो हुन्छ है? म कतै धुवाँ बनेर उडिसकेको हुनेछु तिमीले यो पत्र पढ्दा। मेरो कमजोरीको समयमा, मेरो लागि पनि उर्जा दिएका थियौ तिमीले, यो पढेर पनि तिमी रुनेछैनौ भन्ने आशा गरेको छु। किन दु:ख मान्नु र, म त… १. २०१०, जुन। एकाबिहानै फेसबुक खोल्नु मेरो दैनिकी नै भै सकेको थियो। रिकोमेन्डेड फ्रेन्डस को लिस्टमा यौटा अनौठो नाममा गएर आँखा टक्क अडियो। अना मिका, नयाँ ट्याब हतार हतार खोलेर, फ्रेन्ड"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/8995555525203937062/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2024/09/palpasa.html#comment-form","title":"1 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8995555525203937062"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8995555525203937062"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2024/09/palpasa.html","title":"कथा: पल्पसाको चिठ्ठी।"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmln